sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor C as Client
participant F as RequestForm
participant DMS as DeliveryManagementSystem
participant SA as ServiceArea
participant DR as DeliveryRegistry
C->>F: drop-off 1 George St, Sydney 2000
F->>DMS: checkAddress(address)
DMS->>SA: check(address)
SA-->>F: rejected - outside Greater Melbourne
F-->>C: error, re-enter address
C->>F: 5 Station St, Box Hill 3128
F->>DMS: checkAddress(address)
SA-->>F: accepted
C->>F: review, then S (submit)
F->>DMS: requestDelivery(...)
DMS->>DR: createRequest(...)
DR->>SA: validate(pickup), validate(drop-off)
Note over DR,SA: checked again at the registry, so no caller can bypass it
DR->>DR: new DeliveryRequest (REQUESTED), attach notifier
DR-->>C: DR-0001 + tracking code
